  "hypothesis": "Two naturally earned advancements in one spell skill must be refunded in reverse tier order without erasing practice.",
  "expectedBehavior": "Basic78/80 is ineligible,81/80 eligible; spending reaches Skilled. At level3 both advancements remain; loss to2 refunds Skilled toBasic, loss to1 refunds Basic toUnskilled, regain3 restores2 free slots.",
  "observedBehavior": "Eight full C/JS matches. C menu pages directly show Skilled81/180\u2192Basic81/80\u2192Unskilled81/20 and slots0\u21920\u21920\u21922. Exact JS advancement counts2\u21921\u21920 asserted.",
